1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,036
We create a red circle.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,412
To edge moves it all the way to the top edge.

3
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:07,377
Then to the right edge.

4
00:00:07,533 --> 00:00:09,041
To the bottom edge.

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,068
And to the left edge.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,468
To edge is perfect for placing objects at screen boundaries.

